{"w":2400,"h":3396,"lines":[{"h":0.017565996823799446,"c":1,"t":"Reading","x":0.83475491048790007,"y":0.033428532578402392,"w":0.081676762898763022},{"x":0.076131678977042636,"t":"It's scenarios like these that many researchers are working to avoid. Their objective is to make Al","w":0.83127573649088526,"c":1,"y":0.081272084881978346,"h":0.016195524146054185},{"x":0.0761316890352461,"h":0.017476100382451065,"t":"technologies more trustworthy and transparent, so that organisations and individuals understand","w":0.8209876505533853,"y":0.098837209143144422,"c":1},{"h":0.017441860778592999,"c":1,"t":"how Al decisions are made. In the meantime, says Pachidi, 'We need to make sure we fully","x":0.076131678315635151,"y":0.11627906960764356,"w":0.77983540852864597},{"c":1,"w":0.82716049194335939,"y":0.13368669045526649,"t":"understand the dilemmas that this new world raises regarding expertise, occupational boundaries","x":0.07818930129881721,"h":0.018929588219021465},{"y":0.15253239098118077,"w":0.11316872914632162,"h":0.013250883392226132,"x":0.076131684732394733,"c":1,"t":"and control.'"},{"w":0.82304524739583329,"y":0.18749999985424681,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"t":"Economist Professor Hamish Low believes that the future of work will involve major transitions","x":0.078189310351572963},{"h":0.01598837238037687,"w":0.77777776082356775,"t":"across the whole life course for everyone:ạiThe traditional trajectory of full-time education","c":1,"x":0.076131695500158303,"y":0.20494186031367811},{"h":0.017505203736825292,"c":1,"w":0.81481480916341154,"y":0.22232037710826735,"t":"followed by full-time work followed by a pensioned retirement is a thing of the past,' says Low.","x":0.076131695212532782},{"x":0.076131679917900597,"t":"Instead, he envisages a multistage employment life: one where retraining happens across the life","w":0.8251028951009115,"h":0.017667844522968212,"c":1,"y":0.24116607773631371},{"y":0.26017441845762956,"t":"course, and where multiple jobs and no job happen by choice at different stages.","x":0.076131692473480062,"w":0.68724278767903646,"h":0.016032884483202614,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.017465828445129006,"t":"On the subject of job losses, Low believes the predictions are founded on a fallacy: 'It assumes","w":0.81275721232096354,"y":0.29358068333121068,"x":0.078189294922214575},{"t":"that the number of jobs is fixed. If in 30 years, half of 100 jobs are being carried out by robots,","x":0.078189312235004513,"y":0.31242638382209664,"h":0.017515476797438589,"w":0.81069956461588555,"c":1},{"h":0.016195524146054074,"w":0.8251028951009115,"c":1,"x":0.078189293062405338,"y":0.32979976453074156,"t":"that doesn't mean we are left with just 50 jobs for humans. The number of jobs will increase: we"},{"c":1,"w":0.30115483601888021,"t":"would expect there to be 150 jobs.","h":0.02341799404652023,"x":0.077899782242823123,"y":0.34435955254053496},{"y":0.38080953523389938,"c":1,"x":0.07812752084507546,"h":0.02037999318261019,"w":0.83141174316406252,"t":"Dr Ewan McGaughey, at Cambridge's Centre for Business Research and King's College London,"},{"w":0.76337448120117191,"t":"agrees that 'apocalyptic' views about the future of work are misguided. 'It's the laws that","y":0.39958775025184612,"c":1,"h":0.017667844522968101,"x":0.076131689329179728},{"c":1,"t":"restrict the supply of capital to the job market, not the advent of new technologies that causes","w":0.80041152954101569,"h":0.017496644818740692,"x":0.076131683696653366,"y":0.41860465100253597},{"c":1,"h":0.020729534477170963,"t":"unemployment.'","x":0.077498801014591029,"w":0.14362386067708333,"y":0.43417539041770059},{"c":1,"t":"His recently published research answers the question of whether automation, Al and robotics will","x":0.078189292145503853,"y":0.47232037668981186,"w":0.83127573649088549,"h":0.017505204860116752},{"h":0.020442997468514856,"x":0.076131698135585943,"t":"mean a 'jobless future' by looking at the causes of unemployment. 'History is clear that change","y":0.48691860446379942,"w":0.81687240600585931,"c":1},{"y":0.50581395332264312,"h":0.017448708362377219,"w":0.82716049194335928,"t":"can mean redundancies. But social policies can tackle this through retraining and redeployment.?'","c":1,"x":0.07818930157403324},{"t":"He adds: 'If there is going to be change to jobs as a result of Al and robotics then I'd like to see","y":0.54210836299946963,"x":0.078189303120327999,"h":0.016031172025610996,"c":1,"w":0.81481480916341142},{"y":0.55948174309276189,"w":0.78806584676106783,"x":0.078189298476284627,"h":0.017667844522968212,"t":"governments seizing the opportunity to improve policy to enforce good job security. We can","c":1},{"y":0.57703488356134192,"t":"\"reprogramme\" the law to prepare for a fairer future of work and leisure.? McGaughey's findings","x":0.076131679886739981,"w":0.8251028951009115,"h":0.017488084777364743,"c":1},{"x":0.07818930600523212,"t":"are a call to arms to leaders of organisations, governments and banks to pre-empt the coming","y":0.59593023239798115,"w":0.79629628499348959,"h":0.017441860778592888,"c":1},{"w":0.78189300537109363,"t":"changes with bold new policies that guarantee full employment, fair incomes and a thriving","y":0.6133686690719502,"h":0.017445284570484998,"c":1,"x":0.078189299690806985},{"c":1,"y":0.62952134634402601,"x":0.077842432879076801,"h":0.019048663836907176,"t":"economic democracy.","w":0.19012668609619141},{"h":0.017458980861344786,"x":0.07613168180006985,"y":0.66569767425959514,"t":"ẠạỊThe promises of these new technologies are astounding. They deliver humankind the capacity","w":0.81275721232096343,"c":1},{"y":0.68238472097703107,"w":0.8313987223307292,"h":0.019712043735248042,"c":1,"t":"to live in a way that nobody could have once imagined,' he adds. 'Just as the industrial revolution","x":0.076068247692081356},{"h":0.017474388486504955,"w":0.74485595703125007,"x":0.078189305343056403,"t":"brought people past subsistence agriculture, and the corporate revolution enabled mass","y":0.70200235585318738,"c":1},{"x":0.078189291313551998,"c":1,"t":"production, a third revolution has been pronounced. But it will not only be one of technology. The","w":0.83744857788085936,"y":0.7193757359837315,"h":0.017667844522968212},{"x":0.077957516730481846,"h":0.01696975323842187,"y":0.73682067641605498,"t":"next revolution will be social.'","c":1,"w":0.26385307312011719},{"x":0.89094650190062985,"y":0.90406976770141889,"w":0.02880658467610675,"h":0.01744185965530165,"c":1,"t":"25"}]}